export anchor MoroccanTilesStyle:
    number: 147
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Moroccan tiles
    idea: The dashboard is a tiled courtyard, with white plaster walls, zellige star patterns as borders and dados, the totals set in horseshoe-arched niches and progress filled with glazed tile colours.
    base: light
    palette:
        plaster: #fbf7ef, the page and arch interiors
        sand: #f2e8d6, niches, panel heads and totals
        cobalt: #1f4e8c, the brand, frames, the current tab, this week tiles and the outer focus ring
        emerald: #14654a, the primary button, last week tiles and On track
        saffron: #d9a227, tile centres, heading stars and the inner focus line, never text
        terracotta: #a84a22, the overdue banner, overdue figures and Behind
        amberGlaze: #7a5300, At risk
        ink: #1f2a36, text
        muted: #4f5b66, dates, labels and meta
        grout: #d9ccb4, hairlines and field borders
    type:
        Headings and figures use Hoefler Text, Iowan Old Style,
        Constantia, Cambria, Georgia, serif. Everything else uses
        Seravek, Avenir Next, Avenir, Segoe UI, Noto Sans, sans-serif.
        Greeting 40px in cobalt, niche figures 58px, panel titles 22px
        semibold, row titles 17px semibold, body 16px at 1.5, column
        labels 13px caps.
    layout:
        A 20px zellige dado of cobalt eight point stars with saffron
        centres runs across the top over a cobalt line. The header has
        the star brand, tabs with round arched tops where Home is solid
        cobalt, and on the right an arch topped search, an emerald New
        project button, a round bell and a tile pattern avatar, all over
        a cobalt rule. The courtyard row pairs a horseshoe arch doorway
        framed in tile pattern, holding the greeting, date and a
        terracotta overdue banner, with four tall arched niches, each with
        an icon, a large figure, the label and a tile strip at its foot.
        Below, a cobalt framed table of projects with a coloured star per
        row, name with category and due date, a tile coloured progress bar
        with percent, task count and status, beside the chart panel whose
        bars have pointed tile filled tops, green tiles last week and blue
        this week, plus two totals. Activity spans the width in three
        columns with arch topped initials. A wide tile band closes the
        page. On phones the arch goes above the niches, the niches go two
        by two and table rows become stacked cards.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 32px gutters, 16px between niches, 14 to 16px cell padding.
    density: Medium. A full table beside a calm arched greeting.
    corners: Arched. Niches, tabs, buttons, fields and initials have round tops and 4px bottoms, the greeting is a full horseshoe arch and panels are 6px.
    borders: 2px cobalt frames, zellige bands as dado, footer and style sheet border, dashed grout lines between feed items.
    shadows: None, except a 4px inner shade along the bottom of the primary button like a glazed tile edge.
    icons:
        Eight point stars as markers and the brand, line icons in cobalt
        and emerald. Status uses an eight point star for On track, a
        triangle with a bar for At risk and a hexagon with a dash for
        Behind, beside the word.
    focus: A 3px saffron outline offset 2px inside a 5px cobalt ring.
    tone: Warm and plain, such as Good morning and Green tiles last week.
